OL,3,AChris Mason: Burnham and Swinney tussle
OL,4,Aover where power lies in Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FUK political debate has had a
OL,7,Fdistinctly Scottish feel these last few
OL,8,Fdays.
OL,10,FAs the Scottish National Party has
OL,11,Fgathered for its annual conference at
OL,12,Fthe Event Complex on the outskirts of
OL,13,FAberdeen, the Conservative leader Kemi
OL,14,FBadenoch has been in Paisley and
OL,15,FEdinburgh and the prime minister has
OL,16,Fbeen in Motherwell.
OL,18,FThe SNP is buoyant, its activists
OL,19,Fgathering for the first time since it
OL,20,Fwon, in May, a fifth consecutive
OL,21,FScottish Parliament election, albeit
OL,22,Fwith fewer seats than they won in 2021.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
