OL,3,AOregon teacher fought school attacker
OL,4,Abefore armed dad shot suspect 'multiple
OL,5,Atimes'
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome readers may find this article
OL,8,Fdistressing.
OL,10,FAn Oregon teacher threw her mobile
OL,11,Fphone before she tackled and attempted
OL,12,Fto disarm a teenager who opened fire on
OL,13,Fa special educational needs class.
OL,15,FAs she tried to wrestle a shotgun off
OL,16,Fhim on the floor of the classroom -
OL,17,Fwhere three children and a teacher were
OL,18,Fkilled - a bystander armed with a
OL,19,Fpistol ran inside and killed the teen.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
