OL,3,AThree men jailed for 158 years each for
OL,4,Amurdering Australian and US surfers in
OL,5,AMexico
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe murders sent shockwaves around the
OL,8,Fworld, particularly in Australia, as
OL,9,Fthe area is usually safe from the
OL,10,Fviolence seen in other parts of Mexico.
OL,12,FThe guilty verdict was handed down last
OL,13,Fweek. Debra Robinson, the brothers'
OL,14,Fmother, told the courtroom that her
OL,15,Fsons' murders had taken "the future we
OL,16,Fhad imagined with them".
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/38
